# Patterns to ignore when building/loading this chart, on top of Helm's
# built-in defaults (.git, .DS_Store, etc).

# files/ is a symlink to ../../../volumes so Kong/DB-init/pooler config
# stays single-sourced with docker-compose. Those two subdirectories are
# docker-compose's *runtime* bind mounts (Postgres data dir, uploaded
# Storage objects) - never config, and can grow arbitrarily large. Only
# the config files elsewhere under files/ are meant to be loaded.
files/db/data/
files/storage/
